# Formatting

Use **spaces** for indentation in all repo files. Do not use tab characters.

- **1 indentation level = 4 spaces**
- When editing existing files, match surrounding indentation; convert tabs to spaces if you touch the file.
- Config files (Caddyfile, `.caddy`, quadlets, YAML, markdown) follow the same rule.
